{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Summary\nCI for Gerrit change 2480 exposed a py3.11 xdist leak: `tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py::test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip` created `.rebar-test-sidecar-material` under `Path.cwd()` / repo root. During xdist, another test could snapshot repo root while that directory existed and fail in `tests/conftest.py::_no_repo_root_leaks`.\n\n## Root cause\nThe test fixture used a repo-root scratch directory for its synthetic tracker. That directory was briefly visible to unrelated tests. The fix uses pytest `tmp_path`, which is per-test disposable storage outside the checkout.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip` writes its synthetic tracker under `tmp_path`, not `Path.cwd()` / repo root.\n- [x] The targeted sidecar-material test passes.\n- [ ] The 29a6 Gerrit change 2480 Verified gate no longer fails on `.rebar-test-sidecar-material` repo-root leakage.\n\n## Testing\n- `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py::test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip -q` — passed.\n- `python -m pytest tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_port_exhausted_routine_backoff_does_not_inflate_deploy_errors tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_low_memory_routine_backoff_does_not_inflate_deploy_errors tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_mcp_failure_keeps_the_deploy_failed_metric_and_names_the_component -q` — passed.\n- `make lint` — passed.\n- Gerrit change 2480 Verified rerun pending."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788298299833908001,"uuid":"69abe087-6a47-419d-a956-cf623c2625ab"}